Subject: [PATCH net-next v5 06/15] idpf: remove 'vport_params_reqd' field
Date: Wed, 15 Jul 2026 11:00:31 -0700
Message-ID: <20260715180042.1972010-7-anthony.l.nguyen@intel.com>
X-Mailer: git-send-email 2.47.1
In-Reply-To: <20260715180042.1972010-1-anthony.l.nguyen@intel.com>
